sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / AI Agent
    participant CLI as rhai-cli<br/>(kubectl-odh)
    participant RBAC as RBAC Checker<br/>pkg/util/kube/rbac/
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OLM as OLM<br/>(ClusterServiceVersions)
    participant TrustYAI as TrustYAI Service<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MCP as MCP Server<br/>stdio / SSE 127.0.0.1:8080

    Note over User,K8sAPI: Flow 1: Standard Kubernetes Operations (status, diagnose, components, etc.)
    User->>CLI: kubectl odh status<br/>--kubeconfig credentials
    CLI->>RBAC: SelfSubjectAccessReview<br/>(pre-flight check)
    RBAC->>K8sAPI: POST /apis/authorization.k8s.io/v1<br/>TLS 1.2+ / ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>RBAC: Allowed/Denied
    RBAC-->>CLI: RBAC result
    CLI->>K8sAPI: GET/LIST resources<br/>Dynamic + Discovery clients<br/>TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: Resource data
    CLI-->>User: Formatted output

    Note over User,OLM: Flow 2: OLM Inspection (deps, components)
    User->>CLI: kubectl odh deps
    CLI->>K8sAPI: GET ClusterServiceVersions<br/>GET Subscriptions<br/>TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: OLM resources
    CLI-->>User: Dependency analysis

    Note over User,TrustYAI: Flow 3: TrustYAI Metric Migration
    User->>CLI: kubectl odh migrate trustyai
    CLI->>K8sAPI: GET Route (by label/name)<br/>TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: TrustYAI Route URL
    CLI->>TrustYAI: GET /metrics/schedule<br/>Bearer Token<br/>TLS 1.2+ (InsecureSkipVerify)
    TrustYAI-->>CLI: Metric scheduling data (backup)
    CLI->>TrustYAI: POST /metrics/schedule<br/>Bearer Token<br/>TLS 1.2+ (InsecureSkipVerify)
    TrustYAI-->>CLI: Restore confirmation
    CLI-->>User: Migration result

    Note over User,MCP: Flow 4: MCP Server Mode (AI Agent Integration)
    User->>CLI: kubectl odh mcp serve [--sse]
    CLI->>MCP: Register all subcommands<br/>as MCP tool definitions
    MCP-->>User: Tools available (stdio/SSE)
    User->>MCP: Tool call (e.g., status)
    MCP->>CLI: Execute subcommand
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Kubernetes operations<br/>TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: Results
    CLI-->>MCP: Tool result
    MCP-->>User: JSON response
